{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip into the underpants of <strong>Bru</strong>, a caffeine craving man-child on a mission: <strong>get da milk</strong> for his morning coffee! <strong>Point and click</strong> your way through a vibrant hand-drawn 2D world, featuring a <strong>fully human-voiced</strong> cast of animated townsfolk, and a <strong>groovy original soundtrack</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A throwback to the puzzle point-and-click adventure games of yore, <strong><i>Bru and Boegie: EPISODE 1 - Get Da MILK!</i></strong> serves up a STEAMING HOT cup of  ridiculousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/df24d9b1ca96d6391d3e403283fa9079.poster.avif?t=1755979087\" width=616 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/df24d9b1ca96d6391d3e403283fa9079.webm?t=1755979087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/df24d9b1ca96d6391d3e403283fa9079.mp4?t=1755979087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use revolutionary <strong>Mouse</strong> technology to exert your almighty will on Bru, directing him where to go and what to do! See that shiny interactable object? <strong><i>You can grab it!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/f9746d8d83b6d5edc245f86a5336d3f9.poster.avif?t=1755979087\" width=616 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/f9746d8d83b6d5edc245f86a5336d3f9.webm?t=1755979087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/f9746d8d83b6d5edc245f86a5336d3f9.mp4?t=1755979087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bru</strong> has tighty whitie undies that are not only <i>stylish</i>, but also <i>functional</i>! Store all the items you find in your <strong>PANTSVENTORY\u2122</strong> and use them in the mooniest of moon-logic ways\u00a0to reach your goal of <strong>MILK</strong>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/26eab541219b51e238f7409ef9ab2cb3.poster.avif?t=1755979087\" width=616 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/26eab541219b51e238f7409ef9ab2cb3.webm?t=1755979087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/26eab541219b51e238f7409ef9ab2cb3.mp4?t=1755979087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The local townsfolk of <strong>KIFFTOWN</strong> are ready and waiting to exchange ridiculous banter with Bru, or give him a restraining order for <i>VERBAL HARASSMENT</i>. Blurt out <strong>non sequiturs</strong> if you're feeling <i>saucy</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/493b62158e46323baadb8f05b74ade0b.poster.avif?t=1755979087\" width=616 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/493b62158e46323baadb8f05b74ade0b.webm?t=1755979087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/493b62158e46323baadb8f05b74ade0b.mp4?t=1755979087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appease the hoarder inside us all! <strong>Collect the stickers</strong> littered around the world to unlock a SUPER SECRET SURPRISE.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quotes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I have never played a game this funny...&quot; -\u00a0<i>Krizezivota</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;BRILLIANT. Loved every single thing about it.&quot; -\u00a0<i>latetothegames</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Full animation, big fan, a lotta lotta money went into this game - incredible. Epic cutscenes, 10/10 voice acting.&quot; - <i>GrayStillPlays</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;That was officially one of the strangest games I think I've ever played in my life.&quot; - <i>also</i>\u00a0<i>GrayStillPlays</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cAbsolute masterpiece.\u201d - <i>Alene</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I honestly f*cking loved every minute of this! So witty and clever, all the little comments about the state of the world as well, just brilliant. Great little character and characters, and the voice acting was on par too! I really hope we get more episodes, like, Get Da Sugaaaa!&quot; -\u00a0<i>VonWeavey</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Amazing and unhinged game, I loved it\u201d -\u00a0<i>hyprZona</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;i just finished the game, i just love it, i think this is my new favorite game, or one of them...&quot; -\u00a0<i>dunkkke</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cI LOVE THIS\u201d -\u00a0<i>Jaelix</i></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3711090?t=1755979087","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/6f9e1ebc36f47a4c964e5d6299959f8978ffa7df/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755979087","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/68a8d6de448b73e0295316f99db43e007b91328a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755979087","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/68a8d6de448b73e0295316f99db43e007b91328a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755979087","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3890500,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip into the underpants of <strong>Bru</strong>, a caffeine craving man-child on a mission: <strong>get da milk</strong> for his morning coffee! <strong>Point and click</strong> your way through a vibrant hand-drawn 2D world, featuring a <strong>fully human-voiced</strong> cast of animated townsfolk, and a <strong>groovy original soundtrack</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A throwback to the puzzle point-and-click adventure games of yore, <strong><i>Bru and Boegie: EPISODE 1 - Get Da MILK!</i></strong> serves up a STEAMING HOT cup of  ridiculousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/df24d9b1ca96d6391d3e403283fa9079.poster.avif?t=1755979087\" width=616 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/df24d9b1ca96d6391d3e403283fa9079.webm?t=1755979087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/df24d9b1ca96d6391d3e403283fa9079.mp4?t=1755979087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use revolutionary <strong>Mouse</strong> technology to exert your almighty will on Bru, directing him where to go and what to do! See that shiny interactable object? <strong><i>You can grab it!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/f9746d8d83b6d5edc245f86a5336d3f9.poster.avif?t=1755979087\" width=616 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/f9746d8d83b6d5edc245f86a5336d3f9.webm?t=1755979087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/f9746d8d83b6d5edc245f86a5336d3f9.mp4?t=1755979087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bru</strong> has tighty whitie undies that are not only <i>stylish</i>, but also <i>functional</i>! Store all the items you find in your <strong>PANTSVENTORY\u2122</strong> and use them in the mooniest of moon-logic ways\u00a0to reach your goal of <strong>MILK</strong>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/26eab541219b51e238f7409ef9ab2cb3.poster.avif?t=1755979087\" width=616 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/26eab541219b51e238f7409ef9ab2cb3.webm?t=1755979087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/26eab541219b51e238f7409ef9ab2cb3.mp4?t=1755979087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The local townsfolk of <strong>KIFFTOWN</strong> are ready and waiting to exchange ridiculous banter with Bru, or give him a restraining order for <i>VERBAL HARASSMENT</i>. Blurt out <strong>non sequiturs</strong> if you're feeling <i>saucy</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/493b62158e46323baadb8f05b74ade0b.poster.avif?t=1755979087\" width=616 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/493b62158e46323baadb8f05b74ade0b.webm?t=1755979087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/493b62158e46323baadb8f05b74ade0b.mp4?t=1755979087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appease the hoarder inside us all! <strong>Collect the stickers</strong> littered around the world to unlock a SUPER SECRET SURPRISE.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quotes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I have never played a game this funny...&quot; -\u00a0<i>Krizezivota</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;BRILLIANT. Loved every single thing about it.&quot; -\u00a0<i>latetothegames</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Full animation, big fan, a lotta lotta money went into this game - incredible. Epic cutscenes, 10/10 voice acting.&quot; - <i>GrayStillPlays</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;That was officially one of the strangest games I think I've ever played in my life.&quot; - <i>also</i>\u00a0<i>GrayStillPlays</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cAbsolute masterpiece.\u201d - <i>Alene</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I honestly f*cking loved every minute of this! So witty and clever, all the little comments about the state of the world as well, just brilliant. Great little character and characters, and the voice acting was on par too! I really hope we get more episodes, like, Get Da Sugaaaa!&quot; -\u00a0<i>VonWeavey</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Amazing and unhinged game, I loved it\u201d -\u00a0<i>hyprZona</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;i just finished the game, i just love it, i think this is my new favorite game, or one of them...&quot; -\u00a0<i>dunkkke</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cI LOVE THIS\u201d -\u00a0<i>Jaelix</i></p></li></ul>","developers":["MIKDOG"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/24a1486087eeaad6f3fae612a773d86ffbcc981a/header.jpg?t=1755979087","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2025 Mike Scott","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 14.04.5 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257132831,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132831/movie480.mp4?t=1754430642","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132831/movie_max.mp4?t=1754430642"},"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257132831/0da5e8d59cc2a5b1fd3f8b182a619dde323ae491/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754430642","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.co